{
  "slug": "claude-sqlite-plugin",
  "name": "Claude Sqlite Plugin",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Provide ACID properties to safely store all conversations including images across all sessions. Enable cross-session search.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Commands** (6): `csp-recent` (List the user's most recent Claude Code sessions), `csp-resume` (Resume from any point in any past conversation — search, pick, and reload full context that autocompact destroyed), `csp-search` (Search across all past Claude Code conversations stored in the local SQLite database), `csp-session` (Inspect a specific Claude Code session — metadata plus recent transcript), `csp-start` (Start the csp watcher + web dashboard in the background), `csp-status` (Health check — verify the plugin is running and show database stats)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `claude-sqlite`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-sqlite-plugin@claude-community` from `SongTonyLi/claude-sqlite-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
